    "description": "Fleet roll-up via app-press\u2192app-press event federation (OPERATIONAL_APPS Phase 4). Installed on child instances, it pushes signed summary events (incident lifecycle auto-federated; anything via the federation.push_event workflow action; 5-minute counter rollups) to a parent instance over the standard external-event.v1 gateway. The parent is just another app-press app whose event source happens to be its children \u2014 no new infrastructure, no vendor coupling.",
